    {
      "id": "claim_f4c008f98dc048b3885ea48bda0f4117",
      "statement": "Each analysis-pass notebook owns a dedicated, never-reused range of section numbers (e.g. the first pass owns §1–§10, a mining pass owns §11.x, the next pass takes §12.x), and a second methodologically distinct pass in the same dated folder gets its own numbered docs/ pair (e.g. 06-racionais-*.md + 07-relatorio-*.md) while preserving the original section numbering so existing cross-references keep resolving.",
